@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@token = replace-with-your-local-token

### Health (public)
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Register CRM context
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/interaction-context
Content-Type: application/json
x-demo-token: {{token}}

< ./examples/crm-context.json

### Send AI Agent / Agent Assist webhook
POST {{baseUrl}}/webhook/agent-assist
Content-Type: application/json
x-demo-token: {{token}}

< ./examples/webhook-payload.json

### View active normalized interaction
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/active-interaction
x-demo-token: {{token}}

### View mock CRM writes
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/mock-crm
x-demo-token: {{token}}
